WEBVTT

00:07:58.943 --> 00:08:02.838
behesha me shume vetvetja.

00:08:02.838 --> 00:08:07.420
Sa here qe deshtoja te isha Bruce Lee,

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:11.066
behesha me autentik.

00:08:11.066 --> 00:08:12.551
Ky eshte arti im.

00:08:12.551 --> 00:08:15.871
Une kerkoj gjithnje origjinalitet,

00:08:15.871 --> 00:08:18.106
edhe neqoftese ky i fundit vjen ne nje forme

00:08:18.106 --> 00:08:21.802
qe nuk para pritet.

00:08:21.802 --> 00:08:26.038
Eshte vetem kohet e fundit qe kam filluar te kuptoj

00:08:26.038 --> 00:08:29.745
qe nuk e kam mesuar te qendruarit ulur keshtu

00:08:29.745 --> 00:08:31.891
ngaqe jam Indian.